              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khona-ke uJobe wasukuma waklebhula ingubo yakhe waphuca ikhanda lakhe wawela emhlabathini wakhuleka.",
          "type": "text",
